車場",null,"0ahUKEwii17--8dSWAxWpm68BHRbTFPEQ3IcHCF4oEQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwii17--8dSWAxWpm68BHRbTFPEQ3YcHCGIoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwii17--8dSWAxWpm68BHRbTFPEQ3IcHCGEoEg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["捷運古亭站附近，\n走路約5-10分鐘（看個人腳速）師大商圈中，靠和平東路這側。\n以台北物價來說，價格跟內容，真的CP值高！\n拉麵：細麵，偏硬。\n可以加麵；\n麵條選項：「普通、軟 」；\n\n湯頭鹹度選項：「鹹、普通、淡」。\n\n湯頭口味選項：醬油豚骨、味增豚骨、魚介、湖鹽豚骨.....等。\n\n此次體驗：\n叉燒拉麵（醬油豚骨）：叉燒肉片好幾片，吃起來很滿足，\n鹹度：「普通」，我覺得有點太鹹，湯很濃，下次應該會選偏淡的湯頭。\n\n「炸豬排」：我很滿意！夠厚,不柴，贏過很多家的腰內肉部位豬排。\n\n「薯條+炸雞」：薯條炸的很好，比麥噹噹好吃。\n炸雞口味就比較一般了，\n如果有附沾醬會更棒。\n\n現場只有胡椒粉、七味粉、辣粉可以自行添加。\n-----  -------  ----\n@地獄叉燒拉麵：口味不會太辣、香辣型的，個人覺得蠻喜歡的。\n---- -------\n特別要注意：吃不完打包要另付5元的費用，低銷120元。",null,[0,61]]]],[null,1750751124000000,1750751124000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdWV4bXJMbWJjdXVIM25XampMOHlnZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfdWV4bXJMbWJjdXVIM25XampMOHlnZxoSQ2dzSWxLX3B3Z1lRX0lTc0lB\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwii17--8dSWAxWpm68BHRbTFPEQ_2MIYygT"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4895289665058189553/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvY1ZkRWF6UlRlbEpYVG10TmVHSXlOVmRUVjFKbVdYcGtjVTFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4895289665058189553/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvY1ZkRWF6UlRlbEpYVG10TmVHSXlOVmRUVjFKbVdYcGtjVTFWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4895289665058189553/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvY1ZkRWF6UlRlbEpYVG10TmVHSXlOVmRUVjFKbVdYcGtjVTFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4895289665058189553/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvY1ZkRWF6UlRlbEpYVG10TmVHSXlOVmRUVjFKbVdYcGtjVTFWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/48952896650581